			],
			"Message": "feat(Air/Configuration): Add update channel selection support\n\nThis commit introduces a new `channel` field to the `UpdateConfig` struct, enabling configuration of the release track for the Air daemon's update mechanism.\n\nThe `channel` field is typed as a `String` and defaults to \"stable\". The schema generation logic has been updated to include this field with strict validation, restricting values to the allowed enum: \"stable\", \"insiders\", or \"preview\".\n\nThis change enhances the flexibility of the Air daemon's update policy, allowing distinct deployment configurations for different stability levels, mirroring the release channel strategy often used in code editors.",
			"SHA": "d1f0c7841ced37c76812f7c44c5ed5b2c50edd29"
